  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Repaso: el "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "zugzwang",
            "text": "zugzwang"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " es estar obligado a mover cuando cualquier jugada empeora tu posición. Fischer contra Taimanov, segunda partida de su match de 1971. Juegan las negras: si mueven el rey, pierden el caballo, y si mueven el caballo, el peón de la columna h avanza. Tras dos jugadas de cada bando, el rey blanco llega a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "g6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " y las negras vuelven a estar en zugzwang. Las blancas ganaron."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Recap: "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "zugzwang",
            "text": "zugzwang"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " means being forced to move when every move makes your position worse. Fischer against Taimanov, second game of their 1971 match. Black is to move: if the king moves, the knight is lost, and if the knight moves, the h-pawn walks forward. After two moves each, the white king reaches "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "g6"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " and Black is in zugzwang again. White won."
          }
        ]
      },
      "board": {
        "fen": "8/8/5K2/5BnP/5k2/8/8/8 b - - 0 85",
        "orientation": "white",
        "moves": [
          "Nf3",
          "h6",
          "Ng5",
          "Kg6"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "A veces el zugzwang es de los dos: el que tenga que mover, pierde. Es un "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "mutual-zugzwang",
            "text": "zugzwang recíproco"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Aquí, si juegan las negras, su rey tiene que ir a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d7"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", el rey blanco pasa a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "b7"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " y el peón corona. Si juegan las blancas, no pueden ganar: o dejan al rey negro "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "stalemate",
            "text": "ahogado"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " o le dejan capturar el peón. Son tablas."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Sometimes the zugzwang is on both sides: whoever has to move loses. That is "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "mutual-zugzwang",
            "text": "mutual zugzwang"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". Here, if Black is to move, the king has to go to "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d7"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", the white king steps to "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "b7"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " and the pawn promotes. If White is to move, White cannot win: either the black king is left in "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "stalemate",
            "text": "stalemate"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " or it is allowed to capture the pawn. It is a draw."
          }
        ]
      },
      "board": {
        "fen": "2k5/2P5/1K6/8/8/8/8/8 w - - 0 1",
        "orientation": "white",
        "highlights": [
          "c7",
          "b7",
          "d7"
        ]
      }
