            "text": " con el rey negro en "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e7"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", pero con el turno de las negras. Va de "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", luego a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e4"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " y vuelve a "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". El rey negro tiene que quedarse cerca y no puede hacer lo mismo: se aparta y vuelve, y ahora le toca mover a él. Tiene que ceder el paso."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "If you have no pawn move left, the king can lose the time on its own. That is "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "triangulation",
            "text": "triangulation"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": instead of going straight, it takes a detour round three squares that form a triangle and comes back to the same spot. Here the white king wants to be on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " with the black king on "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e7"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", but with Black to move. It goes from "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " to "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "d5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ", then to "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e4"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " and back to "
          },
          {
            "kind": "square",
            "square": "e5"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ". The black king has to stay close and cannot do the same: it goes away and comes back, and now it is its turn. It has to give way."
          }
        ]
      },
